 the farmland, and there are buildings on exactly <strong>11.0</strong>% of the square footage of the pasture. If there are buildings on exactly <strong><em>p</em></strong>% of the square footage of the plot of land, what is the value of <em><strong>p</strong></em>? &nbsp;</span></span><br>","question":"","options":[],"correct":"20.1","solution":""},{"type":"choice","article":"<span style=\\"font-size:18px;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\\">One of the factors of <span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"8x^4+26x^2+21\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></textarea></span><span class=\\"mq-root-block\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"1\\"><span mathquill-command-id=\\"3\\">8</span><var mathquill-command-id=\\"5\\">x</var><span class=\\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"7\\"><span class=\\"mq-sup\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"9\\"><span mathquill-command-id=\\"8\\">4</span></span></span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"11\\" class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\">+</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"13\\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"15\\">6</span><var mathquill-command-id=\\"17\\">x</var><span class=\\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"19\\"><span class=\\"mq-sup\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"21\\"><span mathquill-command-id=\\"20\\">2</span></span></span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"23\\" class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\">+</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"25\\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"27\\">1</span></span></span>&nbsp;is <span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"ax^2+b\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></textarea>